OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle hit with bB,403m fine by
OL,4,AIrish data watchdog over GDPR
OL,5,Aviolations
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle has been fined bB,403m (#345m)
OL,8,Fby the Republic of Ireland's Data
OL,9,FProtection Commission (DPC) over its
OL,10,Fhandling of location data.
OL,12,FThe penalty - one of the largest of its
OL,13,Fkind imposed by the Irish watchdog
OL,14,Fauthority - followed an inquiry
OL,15,Flaunched into the tech giant six years
OL,16,Fago, following complaints from several
OL,17,FEuropean consumer rights organisations.
OL,19,FOn Monday the DPC said its
OL,20,Finvestigation found Google had
OL,21,Fprocessed data in a manner that was not
OL,22,F"lawful", "fair" or "transparent".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
