OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle hit with bB,403m fine by
OL,4,AIrish data watchdog over GDPR
OL,5,Aviolations
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry concerned Google's
OL,8,Fprocessing of location data in three
OL,9,Fspecific features - Web & App Activity,
OL,10,FLocation History and Location Accuracy
OL,11,Fbetween 25 May 2018 to 4 February 2020.
